  "title": "Mining - Project: Gorgon Wiki",
  "main_content": "Mining\nFrom Project: Gorgon Wiki\nJump to:\nnavigation\n,\nsearch\nMining\nDigging metals and ores out of the ground.\nSkill Type:\nTrade Skill\nMax Level:\n80\nSkill Trainers:\nJaime Fatholm\n,\nUrzab\n,\nDachak the Digger\n“\nDigging metals and ores out of the ground.\nMining Overview\nMining\nis the skill of gathering metals and ores, often leveled through\nSurveying\n.\nIn-Game Description\nDigging metals and ores out of the ground.\nTraining Mining\nMining\nis learned through\nSurveying\n, taught by\nJaime Fatholm\n.\nUrzab\nin\nIlmari\nunlocks levels 51-60 and 61-70, and teaches some higher level mining surveys.\nDachak the Digger\nin\nPovus\nunlocks levels 71-80.\nEngineer Crall\nin\nVidaria\nunlocks levels 81-90.\nConnected Skills\nSub-Skills:\nNone\nSecondary Skills:\nSurveying\n- Used to create\nSerbule Hills Simple Mining Survey\nand other Mining Surveys.\nGeology\n- While\nMining\nis leveled from collecting metal and ores,\nGeology\nis raised through the collection of gemstones.\nRelated Skills:\nBlacksmithing\n- Many blacksmiths will find it useful to have a steady supply of metal from\nMining\n.\nSynergy Levels:\nBonus\nSynergy Levels\nfor\nMining\ncan be obtained from the following skills and levels:\nGeology\nLevel 30\nHammer\nLevel 24, Level 46\nSurveying\nLevel 30, Level 50\nRecipe Lists\nMining\nhas no recipes of its own, as Mining Surveys are crafted using\nSurveying\n. Once crafted, Mining Survey Maps require a certain Level of\nMining\nto use.\nMining\nSurvey Maps\nRecipe\nSurveying Lvl\nMining Lvl\nMining XP Gain\nMap Leads To\nSerbule Hills Simple Mining Survey\n7\n1\n25\nSimple Metal Slab\nor\nBasic Metal Slab\nor\nFlinty Rock\nSerbule Hills Basic Mining Survey\n15\n10\n55\nBasic Metal Slab\nEltibule Good Mining Survey\n25\n15\n70\nGood Metal Slab\nKur Mountains Simple Metal Motherlode Map\n*\n28\n23*\n255\nSimple Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nEltibule Expert Mining Survey\n35\n27\n100\nExpert-Quality Metal Slab\nKur Mountains Basic Metal Motherlode Map\n*\n33\n28*\n300\nBasic Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nKur Mountains Good Metal Motherlode Map\n*\n43\n38\n390\nGood Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nEltibule Masterwork Mining Survey\n45\n35\n130\nMasterwork Metal Slab\nIlmari Desert Expert Metal Motherlode Map\n*\n48\n43\n???\nExpert-Quality Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nEltibule Amazing Mining Survey\n50\n45\n160\nAmazing Metal Slab\nIlmari Desert Master's Metal Motherlode Map\n*\n53\n48\n???\nMasterwork Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nIlmari Desert Amazing Metal Motherlode Map\n*\n58\n53\n???\nAmazing Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nIlmari Desert Astounding Metal Motherlode Map\n60**\n58\n???\nAstounding Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nGazluk Astounding Metal Motherlode Map\n60**\n58\n???\nAstounding Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nor\nMagic Sand\nGazluk Superb Metal Motherlode Map\n65**\n63\n???\nSuperb Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nPovus Astounding Mining Survey\n70\n68\n220 + 80 per attempt***\nAstounding Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nPovus Superb Mining Survey\n75\n74\n???\nSuperb Metal Slab\nand\nOre\nPovus Marvelous Mining Survey\n80\n80\n???\nMarvelous Metal Slab\nand\nOre\n*Motherlodes require 5 more mining levels than the survey to actually mine them despite what the survey says.\n**Higher level Motherlodes require 2 mining levels below the survey to mine them so the required surveying level is higher.\n***Povus surveys can be mined more than once (each attempt has a chance to spawn ratkin)\nHarvestables\nMining Nodes\nAcross\nAlharth\n, mining nodes can be discovered and mined for ores, gemstones, and metal. In\nRahu\n, a prisoner-staffed quarry holds many nodes of various levels. Most types of\nOre\ncan be collected there.\nDeposit\nMining Required\nXP Gained\nLocations\nPyrite\n5\n40\nSome mining nodes are found in the\nMyconian Cave\n.\nWinterprize\n15\n0\nFound in\nWinter Nexus\nSaltpeter\n30\n115\nCave at the far end of the hallway in\nBoarded up Basement\n.\nKur Mountains\nnear the Gaz-Urak and Tor-Urak in north east. Occasionally found in\nYeti Caves\nand\nKur Tower\n.\nSilver Ore\n35\n130\nKur Mountains\nnear Orc Camp, northwest shore.\nBoarded up Basement\ncave area.\nGazluk\nMolybdenum\n35\n130\nMolybdenum Mine\nin\nSun Vale\n.\nGold Ore\n35\n130\nYeti Cave\n, lower levels.\nGazluk\nGood Metal Slab\n35\n130\nMolybdenum Mine\nin\nSun Vale\n.\nIridium\n40\n145\nFound near the Orc camp in\nKur Mountains\n.\nGlowy Yellow Crystal\n45\n0\nScattered across\nGazluk\nin clusters.\nExpert-Quality Metal Slab\n46\n???\nFound in\nGazluk\nas Nodes\nMetal Nodes in Povus giving various minerals including Marvelous Slabs\n50\n200 regardless of what is mined\nFound in\nPovus\nas\nMetal Node\n.\nMasterwork Metal Slab\n51\n130\nFound in\nGazluk\nas Nodes\nAmazing Metal Slab\n56\n130\nFound in\nGazluk\nas Nodes\nPaladium\n??\n170\nFound in\nGazluk\n.\nCinnabar\n55\n200\nFound in\nGazluk\n.\nMotherlode Node\n???\n130\nFound from motherlode\nSurveying\nmaps.\nNodes in Rahu giving random mineral\n35, 40\n?\ncentral\nRahu\nNodes in Rahu giving random mineral\n35, 55\n?\nsouthwest\nRahu\nNodes in Rahu sewer giving random mineral\n?\n?\nvarious locations in the sewer\nAstounding Metal Slab\n62\n130\nFound in\nGazluk\nas Nodes.\nSuperb Metal Slab\n67\n170\nFound in\nGazluk\nas Nodes.\nMarvelous Metal Slab\n75\n250\nFound in\nErrruka's Cave\nand\nNightmare Caves\nas Nodes.\nExtraordinary Metal Slab\n75\n250\nFound in\nErrruka's Cave\nand\nNightmare Caves\nas Nodes.\nMining Mechanics\nUsing a Mining Survey\nGlowy Yellow Crystals\nGlowy Yellow Crystal\nare hazardous rocks often found on the\nGazluk\nPlateau. Known to the Dwarves as Vol's Kiss, these crystals can inflict health-sapping statuses upon the uninformed. Protection against the effects of the crystals can be learned from\nAven\n.  These require level 45 mining to collect.\nMotherlode Map\nMotherlode maps are more difficult than normal surveys, but give much greater rewards. When you use them, no red dot will appear on your minimap, and won't be given the exact location. You'll only be told the distance to the motherlode. If you're 1000 meters away, the motherlode could be on any point in the 1000-radius circle around you. When you find the motherlode, you'll often be rewarded with 15-30 metal slabs, ores, 130 Mining experience, and other rewards.\nMining Level Up Rewards\nLevel\nReward\n15\n+1 to Surveying\n20\n+1 to Hammer\n25\n+1 to Foraging\n35\n+1 to Nature Appreciation\n45\n+1 to Hammer\n50\n+1 to Geology\n65\n+1 to Hammer\nMining Experience Table\nClick Expand to view the Experience Table for Mining\nLevel\nExperience\nTotal Experience\n1\n50\n50\n2\n50\n100\n3\n50\n150\n4\n50\n200\n5\n100\n300\n6\n100\n400\n7\n100\n500\n8\n100\n600\n9\n100\n700\n10\n200\n900\n11\n200\n1100\n12\n200\n1300\n13\n200\n1500\n14\n200\n1700\n15\n400\n2100\n16\n400\n2500\n17\n400\n2900\n18\n400\n3300\n19\n400\n3700\n20\n600\n4300\n21\n600\n4900\n22\n600\n5500\n23\n600\n6100\n24\n600\n6700\n25\n800\n7500\n26\n800\n8300\n27\n800\n9100\n28\n800\n9900\n29\n800\n10700\n30\n1000\n11700\n31\n1000\n12700\n32\n1000\n13700\n33\n1000\n14700\n34\n1000\n15700\n35\n1200\n16900\n36\n1200\n18100\n37\n1200\n19300\n38\n1200\n20500\n39\n1200\n21700\n40\n1500\n23200\n41\n1500\n24700\n42\n1500\n26200\n43\n1500\n27700\n44\n1500\n29200\n45\n2000\n31200\n46\n2000\n33200\n47\n2000\n35200\n48\n2000\n37200\n49\n2000\n39200\n50\n2500\n41700\n51\n2500\n44200\n52\n2500\n46700\n53\n2500\n49200\n54\n2500\n51700\n55\n3000\n54700\n56\n3000\n57700\n57\n3000\n60700\n58\n3000\n63700\n59\n3000\n66700\n60\n4000\n70700\n61\n4000\n74700\n62\n4000\n78700\n63\n4000\n82700\n64\n4000\n86700\n65\n5000\n91700\n66\n5000\n96700\n67\n5000\n101700\n68\n5000\n106700\n69\n5000\n111700\n70\n5000\n116700\n71\n6000\n122700\n72\n6000\n128700\n73\n6000\n134700\n74\n6000\n140700\n75\n6000\n146700\n76\n7000\n153700\n77\n7000\n160700\n78\n7000\n167700\n79\n7000\n174700\n80\n7000\n181700\n81\n9000\n190700\n82\n9000\n199700\n83\n9000\n208700\n84\n9000\n217700\n85\n9000\n226700\n86\n11000\n237700\n87\n11000\n248700\n88\n110