  "lists": [
    [
      "Miningis learned throughSurveying, taught byJaime Fatholm.",
      "UrzabinIlmariunlocks levels 51-60 and 61-70, and teaches some higher level mining surveys.",
      "Dachak the DiggerinPovusunlocks levels 71-80.",
      "Engineer CrallinVidariaunlocks levels 81-90."
    ],
    [
      "None"
    ],
    [
      "Surveying- Used to createSerbule Hills Simple Mining Surveyand other Mining Surveys."
    ],
    [
      "Geology- WhileMiningis leveled from collecting metal and ores,Geologyis raised through the collection of gemstones."
    ],
    [
      "Blacksmithing- Many blacksmiths will find it useful to have a steady supply of metal fromMining."
    ],
    [
      "Trade Skills",
